<title>SPAIN: Asturiana has liquidated LME zinc future position.</title>
<headline>Asturiana has liquidated LME zinc future position.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asturiana de Zinc said on Friday that it had liquidated its entire zinc futures position on the London Metals Exchange.</p>
<p>Asturiana told journalists it had liquidated the position gradually, starting in January and finished on Thursday.</p>
<p>Asturiana said the sales, which it conducted through Glencore International, had not affected market zinc prices.</p>
<p>Asturiana also said it expected its full-year net attributable loss to be 2.68 billion pesetas, with operating profits of 5.34 billion.</p>
</text>
